        <mxCell id="c41" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;읽는 법&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;스코프 = 박스 하나. 안의 작은 박스는 등록한 것들의 종류다.&lt;br&gt;&quot;이벤트 통로&quot;는 MessageBroker 등록, 곧 메시지가 오갈 길을 만들어 두는 것이다. 발행과 구독은 각 클래스가 [Inject] (또는 [Inject] Construct 메서드)로 한다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="800" x="40" y="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c42" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;규칙&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;자식 스코프는 부모에 등록된 것을 주입받을 수 있다. 부모나 형제 것은 볼 수 없다.&lt;br&gt;서버와 클라가 모두 만드는 스코프(PlayerScope 등)에 한쪽 전용 객체를 [Inject]하면, 한쪽에서 실패해 스코프 전체가 무너진다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="800" x="860" y="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c43" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;AI 서비스 &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;모드 분기 한 곳&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;IDeviceCapability.UseServerMode 하나로 LLM · STT를 교체한다. ProjectLifetimeScope가 정하고, NPCLifetimeScope(STT)와 NPCScope(LLM)가 부모에서 읽는다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="123" width="320" x="700" y="1079" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ieGqg-RCFfklm0M7-me6-1" edge="1" parent="1" source="c43" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="c18" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="830" y="792" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="880" y="742" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ieGqg-RCFfklm0M7-me6-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="c43" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c29" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="830" y="792" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="880" y="742" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ieGqg-RCFfklm0M7-me6-3" edge="1" parent="1" source="c43" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c35" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="970" y="1184" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1485" y="972" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;" value="실제로 어떻게 쓰나 — 코드 예시 두 가지" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="900" x="40" y="1412" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_g1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" value="예시 1 — 등록한 클래스를 가져다 쓴다 (IDeviceCapability)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="1620" x="40" y="1472" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_a1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. 부모 스코프가 등록한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ProjectLifetimeScope.Configure&lt;br&gt;서버 모드면 NetworkDeviceCapability,&lt;br&gt;아니면 LocalDeviceCapability를&lt;br&gt;IDeviceCapability로 등록 (Singleton)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="430" x="60" y="1522" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_a2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. 자식 스코프가 부모에서 꺼낸다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCLifetimeScope.Configure&lt;br&gt;Parent.Container.Resolve&amp;lt;IDeviceCapability&amp;gt;()&lt;br&gt;자식은 부모에 등록된 것을 볼 수 있다&lt;br&gt;(Configure 단계는 [Inject]를 못 써서 Resolve를 직접 호출)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="430" x="630" y="1522" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_a3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. 값에 따라 구현체를 등록한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ if (UseServerMode)&lt;br&gt;→ ISTTService = GroqWhisperSTTService&lt;br&gt;▸ else&lt;br&gt;→ ISTTService = WhisperSTTService&lt;br&gt;쓰는 쪽은 ISTTService만 안다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="430" x="1200" y="1522" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_ae1" edge="1" parent="1" source="ex_a1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="ex_a2" value="부모 컨테이너">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_ae2" edge="1" parent="1" source="ex_a2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="ex_a3" value="UseServerMode">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_g2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" value="예시 2 — 이벤트를 보내고 받는다 (PlayerMessageSentEvent)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="1620" x="40" y="1717" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_b1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. 이벤트 통로를 만든다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCLifetimeScope.Configure&lt;br&gt;RegisterMessageBroker&amp;lt;string, PlayerMessageSentEvent&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;키가 string이라 NPC마다 따로 흐르는 통로가 된다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="430" x="60" y="1767" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_b2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. 보낸다 (Publish)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCInteractable.Construct&lt;br&gt;[Inject] Construct로 IPublisher&amp;lt;string, PlayerMessageSentEvent&amp;gt;를 받는다&lt;br&gt;Publish(SessionKey, new PlayerMessageSentEvent(...))&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="430" x="630" y="1767" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_b3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. 받는다 (Subscribe)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCBrain.Construct&lt;br&gt;[Inject] Construct로 ISubscriber&amp;lt;string, PlayerMessageSentEvent&amp;gt;를 받는다&lt;br&gt;Subscribe(myKey, evt =&amp;gt; ...) — 내 키로 온 것만&lt;br&gt;.AddTo(destroyCancellationToken)으로 정리&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="430" x="1200" y="1767" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_be1" edge="1" parent="1" source="ex_b1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="ex_b2" value="IPublisher 주입">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_be2" edge="1" parent="1" source="ex_b2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exit=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="ex_b3" value="같은 키로 전달">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex_note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;핵심&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;쓰는 쪽 클래스는 구현체나 상대 클래스를 직접 참조하지 않는다. 인터페이스(또는 이벤트 통로)만 [Inject] (또는 [Inject] Construct 메서드)로 받고, 연결은 LifetimeScope가 한다.&lt;br&gt;MonoBehaviour는 생성자를 쓸 수 없어서 [Inject] Construct 메서드로 받는다. 대화 한 번의 전체 흐름은 6페이지에서 이어진다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="1620" x="40" y="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="3. 어셈블리 구조" id="page6">
