        <mxCell id="c12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;MySecondWorld.LifetimeScope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;모든 DI 스코프(Project · Player · NPCLifetime · NPCScope · AIModelDownload)를 등록하는 곳. 가장 많은 어셈블리를 참조하는 조립 전용 어셈블리.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
