        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c42" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="c18" value="참조">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c43" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="c20" value="참조">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c44" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="c25" value="참조">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c45" edge="1" parent="1" source="c25" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="c31" value="참조">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c46" edge="1" parent="1" source="c31" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" target="c39" value="참조">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c47" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;화살표 읽는 법&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;화살표는 &quot;위 계층이 아래 계층들을 참조한다&quot;는 방향이다. 바로 아래 계층만이 아니라 더 아래 계층도 건너뛰어 참조하므로(예: Network → Foundation · Save), 정확한 대상은 각 박스의 &quot;참조:&quot; 목록을 본다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="69" width="1610" x="40" y="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c48" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;규칙 1 — 참조 방향은 한쪽, 순환 없음&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;위 계층은 아래 계층을 참조할 수 있고, 반대는 안 된다. 예: Combat → Network는 있지만 Network → Combat는 없다.&lt;br&gt;그래서 서버 권위 공격 판정(PlayerAttackAuthority)은 Network가 아니라 Combat 어셈블리에 두었다. Network에 두면 Network → Combat 참조가 생겨 순환이 된다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="123" width="680" x="40" y="169" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c49" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;규칙 2 — 인터페이스를 아래 계층(Foundation)에 두어 의존을 뒤집는다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Network는 Combat · UI를 볼 수 없다. 그래서 컴패니언은 ICompanionServerState, NPC는 INPCServerState, UI는 IUIManager로 접근한다 (구현체는 위 계층에 있고, 조립은 LifetimeScope가 한다).&lt;br&gt;예: GameNetworkManager(Network)는 IUIManager(Foundation)만 주입받고, 구현체 UIManager는 UI 어셈블리에 있다.&lt;br&gt;같은 방식으로 Customization의 IInventoryActionsProvider · IWeaponEquipActionsProvider를 Network의 NetworkInventoryActions · NetworkWeaponEquip가 구현한다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="141" width="890" x="760" y="169" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c50" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;참고 — 어셈블리 밖 코드&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;에디터 전용 도구(Editor 폴더, 33파일)와 루트의 디버그용 스크립트(DebugButtonRelay · TestManager 등)는 asmdef 없이 기본 어셈블리에 있다. asmdef로 나눈 이점: 스크립트를 고치면 그 어셈블리와 그걸 참조하는 쪽만 다시 컴파일된다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="69" width="1610" x="40" y="1530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6_1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" value="조립 루트 · 공용 기반" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="188" x="860" y="8" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6_2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" value="일반 기능 어셈블리" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="188" x="1054" y="8" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6_3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" value="네트워크 어셈블리" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="188" x="1248" y="8" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6_4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=12;" value="아무것도 참조하지 않음" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="188" x="1442" y="8" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6_5" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="860" y="54" as="sourcePoint" />
