        <mxCell id="c29" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="239" width="1820" x="40" y="556" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c20" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="258" width="1820" x="40" y="196" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;" value="Mirror 네트워킹 — 접속 · 존 스트리밍 · 포탈 전환 · 던전 방" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="1000" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;클라이언트에서 실행&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="210" x="1180" y="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;서버에서 실행&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="210" x="1400" y="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;읽는 법&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;번호는 일어나는 순서 (구간 A~E 안에서 이어서 매긴다). 첫 줄 = 무슨 일이 일어나나, ▸ = 클래스.메서드 (클래스 : 부모 = 상속).&lt;br&gt;박스 색 = 어디서 실행되나 (파랑 클라이언트 / 초록 서버). 주황 화살표 = Mirror 네트워크 메시지 (클라 ↔ 서버), 회색 = 같은 쪽 안의 호출, 점선 = MessagePipe 이벤트.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="109" width="680" x="1180" y="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" value="A. 접속 · 인증 — 비밀번호를 확인하고 로그인 화면을 닫는다" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="31" width="1800" x="40" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. 접속 버튼을 눌러 서버에 연결한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ LoginUI : MonoBehaviour&lt;br&gt;   → IGameNetworkManager.ToggleClient()&lt;br&gt;Mirror의 StartClient()가 실행된다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="148" width="300" x="60" y="216" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. 이름과 비밀번호를 서버로 보낸다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ PlayerAuthenticator : NetworkAuthenticator&lt;br&gt;   .OnClientAuthenticate()&lt;br&gt;AuthRequestMessage에 담아 전송&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="164" width="300" x="430" y="216" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c17" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. 비밀번호를 확인해 통과 / 차단한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ PlayerAuthenticator : NetworkAuthenticator&lt;br&gt;   .OnAuthRequestMessage()&lt;br&gt;기존 계정은 Verify, 신규는 Register (PBKDF2)&lt;br&gt;통과 ServerAccept / 차단 ServerReject&lt;br&gt;AuthResponseMessage로 결과를 돌려보낸다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="218" width="300" x="800" y="216" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c18" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;4. 결과를 받아 로그인 성공을 알린다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ PlayerAuthenticator : NetworkAuthenticator&lt;br&gt;   .OnAuthResponseMessage()&lt;br&gt;ClientAccept() 후 AuthStateChangedEvent 발행&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="182" width="300" x="1170" y="216" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c19" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;5. 로그인 화면을 닫고 메뉴를 연다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ UIManager : MonoBehaviour, IUIManager&lt;br&gt;   .OnAuthStateChanged()&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="109" width="300" x="1540" y="216" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c21" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c16" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c22" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c17" value="로그인 요청">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c23" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c18" value="결과 응답">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c24" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c19" value="MessagePipe">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c25" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" value="B. 스폰 — 서버가 캐릭터를 만들어 월드에 세운다" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="31" width="1800" x="40" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c26" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;6. 세이브를 불러와 스폰 위치를 정한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ GameNetworkManager : NetworkManager, IGameNetworkManager&lt;br&gt;   .OnServerAddPlayer()&lt;br&gt;▸ ServerSessionService.PrepareAndSpawn()&lt;br&gt;SaveManager로 세이브 로드&lt;br&gt;필요하면 번들 다운로드를 먼저 지시&lt;br&gt;AdditiveSceneMessage(씬 로드 지시) + SpawnReadyMessage 전송&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="199" width="520" x="60" y="576" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c27" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;7. 스폰될 지역 씬을 불러온다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ClientSceneSyncService.OnAdditiveSceneMessage()&lt;br&gt;Addressables.LoadSceneAsync(Additive)로 씬 로드&lt;br&gt;SceneLoadedAckMessage로 로드 완료를 서버에 알린다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="520" x="690" y="576" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c28" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;8. 캐릭터를 만들어 월드에 세운다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ServerSessionService.OnSceneLoadedAck()&lt;br&gt;   → SpawnPlayer()&lt;br&gt;PlayerFactory로 생성 → NetworkServer.Spawn&lt;br&gt;던전 씬이면 방 배정 (E 참고)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="163" width="520" x="1320" y="576" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c30" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c27" value="씬 로드 지시">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c31" edge="1" parent="1" source="c27" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c28" value="로드 완료 보고">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c32" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" value="C. 존 스트리밍 — 걸어다니는 동안 가까운 지역의 씬을 미리 불러오고, 멀어지면 내린다" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="31" width="1800" x="40" y="851" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c33" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;9. 플레이어 위치로 필요한 지역을 판정한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ServerZoneService.CheckZones()&lt;br&gt;   → SyncAdditiveScenes()&lt;br&gt;정해진 주기마다 폴링 (zoneCheckInterval)&lt;br&gt;지역 경계를 프리로드 마진만큼 넓힌 범위 안이면 &quot;필요한 씬&quot;&lt;br&gt;지금 서 있는 씬은 절대 내리지 않는다 (무한 낙하 방지)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="181" width="520" x="60" y="917" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c34" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;10. 새로 필요한 씬은 불러오게, 멀어진 씬은 내리게 지시한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ServerZoneService.PlayerEnteredZone()&lt;br&gt;▸ ServerZoneService.PlayerLeftZone()&lt;br&gt;번들이 필요하면 BundleRequiredMessage를 먼저 보냄&lt;br&gt;AdditiveSceneMessage(load = true / false)로 클라에 지시&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="163" width="520" x="690" y="917" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c35" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;11. 지역 씬을 불러오거나 내린다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ClientSceneSyncService.OnAdditiveSceneMessage()&lt;br&gt;load=true면 로드, false면 언로드&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="127" width="520" x="1320" y="917" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c37" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c34" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c38" edge="1" parent="1" source="c34" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c35" value="씬 로드 / 언로드&lt;br&gt;지시">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c39" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" value="D. 포탈 전환 — 포탈을 타면 화면을 어둡게 하고 목적지 씬으로 옮긴다" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="31" width="1800" x="40" y="1174" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c40" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;13. 화면을 어둡게 한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ClientSceneSyncService&lt;br&gt;   .OnScreenFadeMessage()&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="109" width="300" x="430" y="1266" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c41" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;15. 목적지 씬을 불러오고 완료를 알린다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ClientSceneSyncService&lt;br&gt;   .OnAdditiveSceneMessage()&lt;br&gt;로드 후 PortalSceneLoadedAckMessage 전송&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="300" x="800" y="1266" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c42" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;17. 화면을 다시 밝힌다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ClientSceneSyncService&lt;br&gt;   .OnPlayerSceneChangedMessage()&lt;br&gt;소속 씬 전환을 반영하고 페이드 인&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="127" width="300" x="1540" y="1266" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c43" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;12. 포탈 범위 안인지 확인하고 목적지를 정한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ServerZoneService.CheckPortals()&lt;br&gt;   → OnPortalTriggerEntered()&lt;br&gt;ZonePortalTrigger의 범위 안이면 진입으로 판정&lt;br&gt;목적지 씬은 ZonePortalSO 정의로 정한다&lt;br&gt;화면 어둡게 지시 후 그 시간만큼 기다린다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="236" width="300" x="60" y="1574" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c44" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;14. 목적지 씬 로드를 지시한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ServerZoneService.PlayerEnteredZone()&lt;br&gt;페이드가 끝나면 지시&lt;br&gt;(소속 씬은 아직 안 바뀜)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="300" x="430" y="1574" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c45" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;16. 로드 완료를 확인하고 소속 씬을 옮긴다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ ServerZoneService&lt;br&gt;   .OnPortalSceneLoadedAck()&lt;br&gt;   → PlayerChangedScene()&lt;br&gt;ack를 기록하고 MoveGameObjectToScene&lt;br&gt;던전이면 방 배정 (E 참고)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="184" width="300" x="1170" y="1574" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c48" edge="1" parent="1" source="c43" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c40" value="ScreenFadeMessage&lt;br&gt;(화면 어둡게)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c49" edge="1" parent="1" source="c43" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c44" value="페이드 후">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c50" edge="1" parent="1" source="c44" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c41" value="AdditiveSceneMessage&lt;br&gt;(씬 로드 지시)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c51" edge="1" parent="1" source="c41" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c45" value="PortalSceneLoadedAckMessage&lt;br&gt;(포탈 씬 로드 완료)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c52" edge="1" parent="1" source="c45" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c42" value="PlayerSceneChangedMessage + ScreenFadeMessage&lt;br&gt;(씬 전환 알림 · 화면 밝게)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c53" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" value="E. 던전 방 인스턴싱 — 같은 던전 씬 = 방 여러 개. 방마다 플레이어와 몬스터를 따로 보이게 한다 (스폰 · 포탈 전환 중에 서버에서 함께 일어난다)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="31" width="1800" x="40" y="1886" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c54" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;22. 그 방의 몬스터만 화면에 보인다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;같은 matchId의 스폰 메시지만 받는다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="72.5" width="300" x="1180" y="1956" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c55" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;18. 빈자리 있는 방에 배정한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ DungeonRoomRegistry.AssignRoom()&lt;br&gt;같은 던전 씬에도 방이 여러 개&lt;br&gt;기본 정원 4 (인스펙터에서 조정), 없으면 새 방&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="163" width="300" x="60" y="1956" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c56" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;19. 방 번호(matchId)로 보이는 범위를 나눈다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NetworkMatch : NetworkBehaviour&lt;br&gt;   .matchId = roomId&lt;br&gt;플레이어 · 컴패니언의 matchId를 방 번호로 맞춘다&lt;br&gt;같은 matchId끼리만 서로 보인다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="163" width="300" x="430" y="1956" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c57" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;20. &quot;방이 열렸다&quot;고 알린다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ DungeonRoomRegistry.NotifyRoomOpened()&lt;br&gt;새 방이 만들어질 때만 호출 (이미 열린 방이면 알리지 않는다)&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;반드시 matchId 세팅 뒤에 호출&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;OnRoomOpened 이벤트 발행&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="300" x="800" y="1956" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c58" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;21. 그 방의 몬스터를 스폰한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ GameNetworkManager : NetworkManager, IGameNetworkManager&lt;br&gt;   .HandleRoomOpened()&lt;br&gt;   → IRoomWaveSpawner.StartWaves(roomId)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="114" width="300" x="1180" y="2114" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c59" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;23. (나중에) 마지막 인원이 나가면 방을 닫는다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ DungeonRoomRegistry.LeaveRoom() → OnRoomClosed&lt;br&gt;▸ GameNetworkManager : NetworkManager, IGameNetworkManager&lt;br&gt;   .HandleRoomClosed()&lt;br&gt;   → IRoomWaveSpawner.StopWaves(roomId)&lt;br&gt;그 방의 웨이브를 멈추고 몬스터를 풀에 반납&lt;br&gt;(재입장 시 웨이브는 처음부터)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="272" width="300" x="1540" y="1956" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c62" edge="1" parent="1" source="c55" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c56" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c63" edge="1" parent="1" source="c56" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c57" value="이 순서대로">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.1139" y="-22" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-22" y="22" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c64" edge="1" parent="1" source="c57" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="c58" value="이벤트 발행">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c65" edge="1" parent="1" source="c58" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#C77700;fontColor=#C77700;" target="c54" value="Mirror 스폰&lt;br&gt;(같은 matchId 옵저버에게만)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c66" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;설계 메모 2 — 호출 순서&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;matchId를 먼저 세팅하고 NotifyRoomOpened를 나중에 부른다. 반대면 몬스터가 스폰되는 순간 플레이어가 옛 match에 있어 옵저버에서 빠지고, 서버에만 있는 &quot;유령 몬스터&quot;가 된다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="72.5" width="520" x="60" y="2162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c67" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;설계 메모 3 — matchId의 한계&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;matchId는 네트워크 가시성만 나눈다. 물리 세계는 하나라 방끼리 몬스터가 같은 좌표에 겹친다. 데미지 · 어그로 격리는 별도로 넣었다 (아래 F 참고).&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="72.5" width="450" x="640" y="2162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m6BB72YptiYUtTPqGbL5-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="c66" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;entryX=0;entryY=0.29;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;exitX=0.25;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="c56" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="860" y="1984" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="910" y="1934" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cgPoq_gBApjvGY0UbkKJ-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="c58" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="c59" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="680" y="2174" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="750" y="2192" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" value="F. 데미지 · 어그로 격리 — 방마다 몬스터가 같은 자리에 겹쳐 있어서, 물리 판정 결과를 받는 곳마다 같은 방인지 걸러 준다" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="31" width="1800" x="40" y="2320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_grp" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" value="서버" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="430" width="1820" x="40" y="2370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;남의 방 공격은 데미지를 주지 않는다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ Health.TakeDamage()&lt;br&gt;공격자와 같은 방이 아니면 바로 반환한다&lt;br&gt;투사체 · 범위 · 근접 스킬이 모두 이 메서드를 거치므로, 차단은 여기 한 곳이면 충분하다&lt;br&gt;(안 막으면: 내 화살이 안 보이는 몬스터를 때린다)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="400" x="75" y="2420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;남의 방 플레이어는 어그로로 잡지 않는다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ MonsterAI.OnTriggerEnter()&lt;br&gt;▸ MonsterAI.ReacquireTargetsInTrigger()&lt;br&gt;감지 범위에 들어와도 같은 방 대상만 목표로 삼는다&lt;br&gt;(안 막으면: 남의 방 몬스터가 달려와 안 보이는 곳에서 때린다)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="400" x="525" y="2420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;컴패니언은 같은 방 적만 노린다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ CompanionAI.AcquireNearestTarget()&lt;br&gt;서버에서 도는 AI라 모든 방이 다 보인다&lt;br&gt;가장 가까운 적을 고를 때 같은 방인지 거른다&lt;br&gt;(안 막으면: 주인 눈에 안 보이는 적에게 달려간다)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="400" x="975" y="2420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;화살은 남의 방 몬스터를 통과한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ Projectile.TrySweep()&lt;br&gt;다른 방 대상은 명중으로 치지 않고 계속 날아간다&lt;br&gt;데미지는 Health에서도 막히지만, 여기서도 걸러야 화살이 허공에서 멈추지 않는다&lt;br&gt;(안 막으면: 안 보이는 것에 맞아 화살이 멈춘다)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="400" x="1425" y="2420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_c" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;같은 방인지 판정한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ MatchScope.Same(a, b)&lt;br&gt;두 오브젝트의 NetworkMatch.matchId를 비교한다&lt;br&gt;서버에서만 유효하다 (클라이언트에는 matchId가 동기화되지 않는다)&lt;br&gt;판단 근거가 없으면 통과시킨다 (fail-open) — 막는 쪽으로 짜면 기존 필드 전투가 죽는다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="1000" x="450" y="2640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_e1" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_c" value="같은 방인가?">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_e2" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_c" value="같은 방인가?">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_e3" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_c" value="같은 방인가?">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_e4" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_c" value="같은 방인가?">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="memo3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;설계 메모 1 — 씬 전환 완료는 ACK로 확인한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;페이드는 정해진 시간만 기다린다. 하지만 &lt;u&gt;씬 로드가 끝났는지는 클라이언트가 보내는 ACK로 확인&lt;/u&gt;한다.&lt;br&gt;기기마다 로드 시간 편차가 커서 고정 타이머로는 맞출 수 없기 때문이다.&lt;br&gt;ACK가 오지 않아도 제한 시간(portalAckTimeoutSeconds)이 지나면 강제로 진행한다 (화면이 검게 멈춘 채 남지 않게).&lt;br&gt;(스폰: SceneLoadedAckMessage / 포탈: PortalSceneLoadedAckMessage)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="300" x="780" y="1574" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xTn20xsWsT2GZo2Y0kSD-1" edge="1" parent="1" source="c66" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=0.25;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="c57" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry">
