        <mxCell id="mic_stt" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;ISTTService — 1개 (음성 → 글자)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ GroqWhisperSTTService (클라우드) / WhisperSTTService (로컬)&lt;br&gt;Microphone.Start(null) — 기기 마이크 1개를 이 서비스 하나만 쓴다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
