        <mxCell id="iso_g1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" value="규칙 ① 대화창은 한 번에 한 NPC만 점유한다 (_activeInteraction)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="1620" x="40" y="2010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_a1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. NPC A가 대화창을 쓰는 중&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCInteractable&lt;br&gt;static 필드 _activeInteraction = NPC A&lt;br&gt;(메뉴창 · 대화창 · 상점창은 하나뿐인 공유 UI)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="420" x="80" y="2060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_a2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. NPC B가 Menu에 들어온다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCInteractable.OnEnterMenu()&lt;br&gt;_activeInteraction이 B가 아니면 이전 점유자부터 정리한다&lt;br&gt;안 그러면 두 NPC가 동시에 Menu · Shopping에 들어가는데 화면에는 마지막 것만 보이는 모순이 생겼다&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="420" x="620" y="2060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_a3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. A를 강제 정리하고, B가 점유한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCInteractable.ForceReset()&lt;br&gt;NPCBrain.OnConversationEnded(), 메뉴창 · 대화창 · 상점창 닫기, 카메라 해제&lt;br&gt;A는 Idle부터 다시 시작하고 _activeInteraction = B&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="420" x="1160" y="2060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_ae1" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_a1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_a2" value="새 NPC가 진입">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_ae2" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_a2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_a3" value="ForceReset()">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_g2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;fillOpacity=35;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;" value="규칙 ② 메시지는 자기 NPC에게만 간다 — 같은 정체성을 공유하는 컴패니언이 엿듣지 못하게" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="245" width="1620" x="40" y="2255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_b1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. 원인: 같은 NpcGuid를 공유하는 NPC가 둘 이상이다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPC_Ari와 Companion_Ari&lt;br&gt;같은 NPC 데이터(NpcGuid)를 쓰면 이벤트 키가 겹쳐서, 한 번 말하면 두 NPCBrain이 모두 답변을 만들었다 (크로스토크)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="420" x="80" y="2305" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_b2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. 키를 인스턴스 단위로 분리한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCInteractable.SessionKey&lt;br&gt;NpcGuid + 인스턴스 ID&lt;br&gt;PlayerMessageSentEvent → NPCResponseReceivedEvent → NPCTTSSentenceEvent → NPCStopTTSEvent 전 구간의 라우팅 키&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="420" x="620" y="2305" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_b3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. 안전망: 대화 중인 NPC만 처리한다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;▸ NPCBrain / NPCInteractable.IsConversationActive&lt;br&gt;짝 NPCInteractable이 Talking 또는 Generating일 때만 메시지를 처리한다&lt;br&gt;컴패니언을 소환 해제하면 NPCBrain도 꺼서 구독이 남지 않게 한다 (OnPresenceChanged)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="420" x="1160" y="2305" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iso_be1" edge="1" parent="1" source="iso_b1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="iso_b2" value="키를 분리">
